/**
 * Cloud Foundation Fabric (CFF) Module Variant for Stage 2 (Security)
 *
 * If you are working directly with the official Cloud Foundation Fabric repository,
 * FAST Stage 2 uses high-level CFF modules (`project`, `kms`, and `secret-manager`)
 * instead of raw Terraform resources.
 *
 * Below is how the security core project, KMS keyrings, and secrets are configured
 * using Cloud Foundation Fabric modules:
 */

/*
module "sec_project" {
  source          = "github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-foundation-fabric//modules/project?ref=v34.0.0"
